Sval: Firefox's AI features never start

Smart Window, the sidebar chatbot and link previews each start from a
startup category. Sval ships none of them (spec §2, principle 6), so
their registrations go, and AIWindow.init never moves #PanelUI-button
beside the tab strip. Their modules stay, because code across the
browser asks them, through lazy getters, whether a feature is on, and
the locked prefs answer that it is off.

